 ipv4-family vpnv4
  bestroute igp-metric-ignore
  peer 192.0.2.1 enable
#
```

### Key Points:
- **Command**: `bestroute igp-metric-ignore`  
  This ensures BGP skips the IGP metric (cost to next hop) during best-path selection.
