PE1 (Primary) ---[Primary Path]--- RR ---[Backup Path]--- PE2 (Backup)
```
- RR reflects VPNv4 routes from PE1 and PE2 to the local router, enabling FRR to use PE2 as backup when the primary path (PE1) fails.

This configuration ensures sub-second failover for VPN services by leveraging BGP FRR with BFD for rapid fault detection.
