 mpls ldp  # or `mpls rsvp-te` if using RSVP-TE
 quit
```

### 3. **Set Up BGP Labeled Unicast**
```bash
bgp 65001  # Replace with your ASN
 peer 192.168.5.2 as-number 65002  # Replace with peer's ASN
