 ipv4-family labeled-unicast
  peer 192.168.5.2 enable
  peer 192.168.5.2 label-route-capability  # Advertise labels
  route recursive-lookup tunnel  # Enable tunnel reachability check
 quit
```

### 4. **Define Loopback Interface**
```bash
interface LoopBack0
