  aggregate 10.0.0.0 8 detail-suppressed
  advertise active-route
  peer 192.0.2.1 enable  # Enable BGP peer if needed
```

This configuration ensures the supernet route (e.g., `10.0.0.0/8`) is advertised to peers in VPN `vpnb`, while suppressing more specific prefixes. Adjust the IP address, mask length, and ASN to match your network.
