  Capabilities: 
    IPv6 Unicast: advertised and received
    Route Refresh: advertised and received
  Advertised Routes: 25   Received Routes: 40
  Last Error: None
```

This command provides comprehensive insights for troubleshooting and validating BGP IPv6 peer sessions.
