      Network            NextHop        MED        LocPrf    Path/Ogn
 *>   192.168.1.0/24    172.16.25.42   0          100        65002?
 *>   192.168.2.0/24    172.16.25.42   0          100        65002?
```

This confirms routes received from peer `172.16.25.42`.
