  - Verify peer status: `display bgp peer 172.16.25.42`.
- **View Routes After Policy Processing**:
  ```bash
  display bgp routing-table peer 172.16.25.42 routes
  ```

This command provides visibility into all BGP routes received from the specified peer, essential for debugging and verification.
