- Ensure the VPN instance `customer_A` exists and has BGP VPNv6 configured.
- Verify the peer-group index `15` is correct (use `display bgp vpnv6 vpn-instance customer_A group` to list indices).
- If no output is shown, confirm the peer-group configuration and session status.

