Min Tx Interval (ms): 15
Min Rx Interval (ms): 20
Detect Multiplier   : 8
```

This configuration ensures rapid failure detection (down to **160ms worst-case**) while aligning with the requirements for the WEST_REGION peer group. Adjust if hardware limitations require higher intervals.
