   bgp 65001
    peer 192.168.5.5 as-number 65001
    peer 192.168.5.5 connect-interface LoopBack0
    ipv4-family vpnv4
      bestroute external advertise
      peer 192.168.5.5 enable
      peer 192.168.5.5 advertise best-external
   ```

### Verification Commands:
- `display bgp vpnv4 routing-table best-external`  
- `display bgp vpnv4 peer 192.168.5.5 verbose` (look for `Advertise best-external: Yes`)

This configuration ensures that backup paths (best-external routes) are advertised to the specified IBGP peer, enhancing network resilience.
