  route-policy vpn_filter permit node 10
    if-match ip-prefix PREFIX_LIST
  ```
- **RD-Based Filtering**:
  ```bash
  route-policy vpn_filter permit node 10
    if-match rd 65000:200
  ```

This configuration ensures only routes matching `vpn_filter` are accepted from `192.168.50.30`.
