[Huawei-bgp] ipv4-family unicast
[Huawei-bgp-ipv4] peer CORE_GROUP enable
[Huawei-bgp-ipv4] commit
```

This adds `192.168.50.25` to `CORE_GROUP` and enables IPv4 unicast routing for the peer.
