 peer 2001:DB8:2::2 as-number <peer_as_number>  # Specify peer's AS number
 peer 2001:DB8:2::2 enable  # Enable the BGP peer
 ipv4-family unicast  # Enter IPv4 unicast address family view
  peer 2001:DB8:2::2 enable  # Activate peer for IPv4 unicast
  peer 2001:DB8:2::2 advertise add-path best number 6  # Advertise best + 5 alternative paths
```

### Explanation:
