!
bgp 65000
  ipv4-family vpnv4
    peer 192.168.55.66 enable
    peer 192.168.55.66 route-policy bgp_filter123 import
```

This configuration ensures only VPNv4 routes from `192.168.55.66` matching the rules in `bgp_filter123` are accepted. Adjust match conditions to fit your requirements.
