   ```bash
   ipv4-family mvpn
     peer 192.168.5.20 enable
   ```

3. **VPNv4 Multicast Context**: VPNv4 multicast routes use the **MVPN address family** (`ipv4-family mvpn`), not the standard VPNv4 unicast family.

### Complete Configuration Snippet:
```bash
system-view
  bgp 65001
    ipv4-family mvpn
      peer 192.168.5.20 enable
      peer 192.168.5.20 route-policy bgp_filter123 import
    commit
```

