- Check applied policies:
  ```bash
  display bgp ipv4 mvpn import-route-policy
  ```
- Monitor received routes:
  ```bash
  display bgp ipv4 mvpn routing-table peer 192.168.5.20 received-routes
  ```

This configuration ensures that incoming BGP VPNv4 multicast routes from `192.168.5.20` are filtered according to the rules defined in `bgp_filter123`.
