## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
refresh bgp vpnv4 multicast { <ipv4-address> | all | external | internal | group <group-name> } { export | import }
FuncDef:
The refresh bgp vpnv4 multicast command softly resets a BGP connection. BGP soft reset can be used to refresh the BGP routing table and apply new routing policies, without closing any BGP connection.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'ipv4-address', 'Info': 'Specifies the IPv4 address of a BGP peer.\nIt is in dotted decimal notation.'}
{'Parameters': 'all', 'Info': 'Softly resets all the BGP IPv4 connections.\n-'}
