system-view
bgp 65000
 group internet_peers external
 peer internet_peers as-number 65001
 peer 192.0.2.1 group internet_peers
 peer 192.0.2.2 group internet_peers
 commit
```

### Verification Commands:
- Check peer group status:
  ```bash
  display bgp peer group internet_peers
  ```
- Verify BGP peers:
  ```bash
  display bgp peer
  ```

This configuration ensures all peers in `internet_peers` use AS 65001, simplifying setup for multiple EBGP neighbors.
