   ```bash
   <Huawei> system-view
   ```

2. **Enter BMP Configuration View:**
   ```bash
   [Huawei] bmp
   ```

3. **Create a BMP Monitoring Station** (e.g., `STATION1`):
   ```bash
   [Huawei-bmp] monitor-station STATION1
   ```

