bmp
 monitor-station STATION1
  vpn-instance customer_vpn
  peer 192.168.100.5
 commit
```

### Verification Commands:
- Check BMP status:
  ```bash
  display bmp monitor-station STATION1
  ```
- Monitor connections:
  ```bash
  display bmp monitor-station connection
  ```

