bgp 65001
 ipv6-family vpn-instance CUSTOMER_VPN
  peer 2001:DB8:2::2 log-change
  commit force
  quit
 quit
save
```

This setup ensures all BGP session state changes for the peer `2001:DB8:2::2` in the specified VPN instance are logged.
