    peer 2001:DB8:2::2 enable  # Activate the peer
   ```

### 4. **Enable Best-External Route Advertisement**
   ```bash
   bestroute external-advertise  # Enable best-external route calculation
   peer 2001:DB8:2::2 advertise best-external  # Advertise best-external routes to the peer
   ```

### 5. **Verify Configuration**
   ```bash
   display bgp vpnv4 all peer 2001:DB8:2::2  # Check peer status
   display bgp vpnv4 all routing-table best-external  # View best-external routes
