To configure the Huawei NE40E router to filter incoming BGP VPNv6 routes using the IPv6 prefix list named "customer-routes," follow these steps:

### Step 1: Create the IPv6 Prefix List
Define the prefix list "customer-routes" to specify allowed/denied IPv6 prefixes. Replace `[PREFIX]` and `[LENGTH]` with your specific values.
```bash
[~HUAWEI] ip ipv6-prefix customer-routes index 10 permit [PREFIX] [LENGTH]
```
**Example** (permits 2001:db8:1234::/48):
