- If routes are unexpectedly blocked, check ACL6 rules and ensure a `permit any` exists (if needed).  
- Confirm the ACL6 is attached to the correct peer in the `vpnv6` family.  
- Use `reset bgp ipv6 vpnv6 export 2001:db8:1::1` to reset outbound sessions after changes.  

This configuration ensures the ACL6 "VPN_FILTER" controls which VPNv6 routes are advertised to `2001:db8:1::1`.
